Gen 15:1 , God encourages Abram, who complains for want of an heir;
Gen 15:4 , God promises him a son, and a multiplying of his seed;
Gen 15:6 , Abram is justified by faith;
Gen 15:7 , Canaan is promised again, and confirmed by a sign, and a vision, prophetic of the condition of his posterity till brought out of Egypt.
